  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Construct Mana Cannon Arms"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Mana cannon arms give constructs the ability to "
        },
        {
          "text": "attack at range",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", but due to the intricacy of the construction, this arm cannot be used for melee attacks.\n\nThese magic attacks can be very powerful depending on the material used to craft the arm. A "
        },
        {
          "text": "mana torso",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " is required for these to function, as well as periodic recharging by "
        },
        {
          "text": "mana pylons",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wood",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 3 damage\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stone",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 5 damage\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bone",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 3 damage\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Iron",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 7 damage\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Obsidian",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 10 damage\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Diamond",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 15 damage\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gold",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ": 20 damage\n\nIf a construct has 2 mana cannon arms, it can target 2 different enemies per shot."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
